---
hideCta: true
headerPhoto: "5290424"
seoTitle: "Contact SCIPS in West Bromwich"
layout: layouts/page.njk
title: Contact us
description: "Call 0121 544 1230, email enquiries@scips.org.uk or visit SCIPS at the National Metalforming Centre, Birmingham Road, West Bromwich B70 6PY."
lede: You don't need a referral. Call, email or use the form below and tell us what's happening where you live.
topics: [["general","A general question"],["start","Starting a residents' group"],["group","Support for an existing group"],["training","Training"],["involved","Getting involved"],["issue","An issue in my area"]]
towns: ["West Bromwich","Oldbury","Rowley Regis","Smethwick","Tipton","Wednesbury","Outside Sandwell"]
---
<div class="section">
  <div class="container grid">
    <div class="span-7">
      <h2>Send us a message</h2>
      <p class="mt-s muted">Fields marked optional can be left blank. We only use your details to reply to you.</p>

      <div class="error-summary mt-m" data-error-summary role="alert" tabindex="-1" aria-labelledby="error-summary-title">
        <h2 id="error-summary-title">There is a problem</h2>
        <ul data-error-list></ul>
      </div>
      <div class="notice mt-m" data-form-notice role="status" tabindex="-1">
        <strong>Your email app should now open with your message.</strong> Press send in your email app to send it to us. If nothing happened, email us at <a href="mailto:{{ site.email }}">{{ site.email }}</a>.
      </div>

      <form class="form mt-l" action="mailto:{{ site.email }}" method="post" enctype="text/plain" novalidate data-contact-form>
        <div class="field" id="field-name">
          <label for="name">Your name</label>
          <p class="error-message" id="name-error"><span class="visually-hidden">Error:</span> Enter your name</p>
          <input id="name" name="name" type="text" autocomplete="name" required aria-describedby="name-error">
        </div>
        <div class="field" id="field-email">
          <label for="email">Email address</label>
          <p class="hint" id="email-hint">We'll use this to reply to you</p>
          <p class="error-message" id="email-error"><span class="visually-hidden">Error:</span> Enter an email address in the correct format, like name@example.com</p>
          <input id="email" name="email" type="email" autocomplete="email" spellcheck="false" required aria-describedby="email-hint email-error">
        </div>
        <div class="field field--narrow">
          <label for="phone">Phone number (optional)</label>
          <p class="hint" id="phone-hint">If you'd prefer us to call you back</p>
          <input id="phone" name="phone" type="tel" autocomplete="tel" aria-describedby="phone-hint">
        </div>
        <div class="field field--narrow">
          <label for="town">Where do you live? (optional)</label>
          <select id="town" name="town">
            <option value="">Choose a town</option>
            {% for t in towns %}<option>{{ t }}</option>{% endfor %}
          </select>
        </div>
        <div class="field">
          <label for="topic">What is your message about?</label>
          <select id="topic" name="topic">
            {% for t in topics %}<option value="{{ t[0] }}">{{ t[1] }}</option>{% endfor %}
          </select>
        </div>
        <div class="field" id="field-message">
          <label for="message">Your message</label>
          <p class="error-message" id="message-error"><span class="visually-hidden">Error:</span> Enter your message</p>
          <textarea id="message" name="message" rows="6" required aria-describedby="message-error"></textarea>
        </div>
        <div class="field" id="field-consent">
          <p class="error-message" id="consent-error"><span class="visually-hidden">Error:</span> Confirm that we can use your details to reply</p>
          <div class="checkbox">
            <input id="consent" name="consent" type="checkbox" value="yes" required aria-describedby="consent-error">
            <label for="consent" style="font-weight:400">I agree that SCIPS can use these details to reply to my message, as explained in the <a href="/privacy/">privacy notice</a>.</label>
          </div>
        </div>
        <input class="hp" type="text" name="website" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off" aria-hidden="true">
        <div><button class="button" type="submit">Send message</button></div>
      </form>
    </div>

    <section class="next-steps span-7" aria-labelledby="next-title">
      <h2 id="next-title">What happens next</h2>
      <ol class="steps mt-m">
        <li><div><h3>We read your message</h3><p>A member of the team reads every message and passes it to the right person.</p></div></li>
        <li><div><h3>We get back to you</h3><p>We'll reply by email, or call you if you've left a number and would prefer that.</p></div></li>
        <li><div><h3>We agree a next step</h3><p>That might be information, a meeting, training, or help to raise an issue. There's no obligation.</p></div></li>
      </ol>
    </section>

    <aside class="span-4 start-9">
      <dl class="facts">
        <div><dt>Phone</dt><dd><a href="tel:{{ site.phoneHref }}">{{ site.phone }}</a></dd></div>
        <div><dt>Email</dt><dd><a href="mailto:{{ site.email }}">{{ site.email }}</a></dd></div>
        <div><dt>Open</dt><dd>{{ site.hours }}</dd></div>
        <div><dt>Address</dt><dd>{% for line in site.address %}{{ line }}{% if not loop.last %}<br>{% endif %}{% endfor %}</dd></div>
      </dl>
      <div class="mt-l">{% include "partials/map.njk" %}</div>
    </aside>
  </div>
</div>
